<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.8">
<l>tiraiporu kaṭalcūḻ tiṇmatiḷ tuvarai vēntu taṉ maittuṉaṉ mārkkāy</l>
<l>araciṉai yaviya varaciṉai yaruḷu maripuru ṭō ttama ṉamarvu</l>
<l>nirainirai yāka neṭiyaṉa yūpam nirantara moḻukkuviṭ ṭiraṇṭu</l>
<l>karaipurai vēḷvip pukaikamaḻ kaṅkai kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The abode of Hari Puruṣottama</l>
<l rend="indent">who, as king of strong walled Dvārakā,</l>
<l>surrounded by a sea of crashing waves,</l>
<l rend="indent">when the kings were defeated,</l>
<l>granted the kingdom to his cousins,</l>
<l rend="indent">is the protected city called Kaṇṭam</l>
<l>on the ganges where the fragrant smoke</l>
<l rend="indent">of sacrificial fires spreads,</l>
<l>the two banks resembling the tall sacrificial posts row on row</l>
<l rend="indent">[from which smoke] emits, flowing endlessly.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
